{
  "title": "Quietly Nutty Egyptian Lentil Curry",
  "description": "A hearty and nutritious post-workout Egyptian dish featuring curry powder and binchotan-charcoal, this shojin-friendly lentil curry is perfect for a quick and easy dinner",
  "cuisine": "Egyptian",
  "diet": [
    "vegetarian",
